  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "4上"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "现代\n3:32 P.M.  天气/晴\n萨尔贡中部，伊巴特地区，无名城镇"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......你想跟我们走......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "你应该明白，对我们而言，你只是个可疑分子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "检查过你的队伍了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "暴雨？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......一切正常。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "但我不信任你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "嗯嗯，说得好，我当然不值得信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "你的目的是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我的目的是......找到我的目的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "你在说什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "你们知道吗？伊巴特地区的王酋——曾惨死在火灾之中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......那是两三年前的事了。现任王酋是他的儿子，在伊巴特地区引发了不小的骚动......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "多亏了那场火，我还不得不重新找个老东家，多花几个月时间适应新工作，烦人得很。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "是啊，是啊，可那是我的最后一个猎物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "织好了网，铺好了陷阱，却没有猎物，我现在，很无所事事啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "——你、你杀死了一位王酋......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "萨尔贡的军队会找上你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "——不，等等，你为什么要告诉我们！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "啊，不愧是黑市里的常客。是啊，除了你们和我，没有人知道王酋的死和我有关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "至于萨尔贡的军队嘛......今非昔比，统治伊巴特地区的帕夏，可完全瞧不上这片荒芜的土地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我想，帕夏应该不会在乎是父亲还是儿子当领主吧，其实我也不是很在乎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我只是索求他的死亡，很简单的要求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "你的目的到底是什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "复仇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "这个答案太无趣了，所以我从来不会回答。也许这片大地上有一半的人类都有自己复仇的目标，对敌人，对城市，对这片大地，怎么都好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "二十多年过去了，我一直在做这一件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "权力、地位、财富，这些都是附属品，如果有必要，丢掉就丢掉吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "或者，我会全部赠送给，“罗德岛”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "这可是前所未有的酬宾了，不是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "呵，看来你还是不愿意信任我，谨慎的小姐，你以前是军人吗，萨尔贡的军人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "——与你无关。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "你呢，年轻的“桥”？或者我该称呼你如今的名字，“慑砂”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "慑砂，他不值得信任。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......你隐瞒了某些很关键的事情吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "唔？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "哦......是了，是啊，我怎么把这都忘了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "你们自诩是一个治疗感染者的医疗公司......好吧，我就暂且相信这片大地上还有这么异想天开的一群人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我是一名感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我拥有足够匹敌王酋的财富，也拥有能够陷害一位王酋的人脉与实力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我用这全部，交换一份治疗机会，怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "——你疯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我常这么觉得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "但没有人是不想活命的。我抛弃这一切来寻求治疗，难道不合理吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "不，我想暴雨不是在说这个。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "你竟然连自己是感染者这件事，都毫不在意......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "那你到底想在罗德岛得到什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "好吧，时间也不多了，让我们坦诚相待吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我要找“凯尔希”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "也许她会告诉我很多事情，也许她会为我指出一条出路......当然，更多的可能是，她都不会做，狡诈地，把选择权重新交给我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "但就算那样也可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "在每一位参与当年事件的人都被我逐一清除干净后，我对萨尔贡再无依恋，我迫切地想要离开这块令人作呕的土地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我需要一个新的开始。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "正巧在这个节点上，谁会放过一个出现在自己面前的，过去的影子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......凯尔希医生和你是什么关系？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "啊哈......说来话长。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "她是我的救命恩人。我很感谢她，发自肺腑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "决定权不在我们......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......三年前，伊巴特王酋在旅途中死于一场大火，那场大火烧光了整座城镇，之后，他的儿子掀起了叛乱，和其他人争夺王酋之位。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "是你做的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "如我所说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "喔，陈年往事罢了，我只是在本来就满是间隙的可悲亲情之间插入了一些小小的......楔子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "你为什么想要知道这个？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......我在找一条线索，拜你所赐，我不得不终止了在伊巴特地区的调查。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "哦......线索。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "也许这也可以成为你信任我的契机，说说看吧，但愿我能帮得上忙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "我在找一个人。一个哥伦比亚的军工实验负责人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "你在调查哥伦比亚的公司，为什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......因为我最尊敬的人死在了一场可笑的意外里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "如果那真的只是场意外？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "那我也要......得知真相。何况这也不是那些人踩着我兄长的死往上升官的理由吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......慑砂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "我知道，这是我的个人问题了......但机会难得，是吧，“沙卒”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "呵呵，咳，失礼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "我说什么来着？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "几乎每个活着的人，都需要复仇，对象可大可小，执念可深可浅。复仇是人生的一个永恒的母题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "如果你们允许我前往罗德岛接受治疗，我可以为你调查这件事。当然，刚才说的所有交易依旧全部作数。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "哪怕是门外那批货物的十倍数量，我都有渠道可以解决，而且价格低廉，手尾干净，于一家制药企业而言，这再划算不过了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......慑砂，抱歉，你的个人诉求不能被算作筹码。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "这我当然知道......我只是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "对了......我险些忘了，看来我最近很容易忘事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "那个老伊辛留下的预言，我从没当真过。但事到如今再去想想，也许预言其意，只是某种交涉和沟通。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "呵，预言......血肉凡胎可做不到与时间平起平坐。哪有这么便利的源石技艺呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "......预言？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "可惜老伊辛已经不在了，罢了，希望她还记得这个约定吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "她是否有......多交给你们一枚金币？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "一枚萨尔贡的古老金币。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "暴雨，慑砂，有情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "别慌，咋了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "......有很多可疑的队伍，他们在靠近这座城镇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "提醒各位，来者不善。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "呃，而且速度很快，如果现在要跑我们还来得及，再慢的话，就避不开交火了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "十五分钟，我们最多就剩十五分钟，队长，副队长，动作得快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "——是你的人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "怎么会呢，我如今可是孤家寡人了。人可没有机械值得信赖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "不过，他们大概都是冲着我来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "——该死的，你算好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "要么帮我逃走，要么咱们一起对付这些不知天高地厚的杀手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "如何？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴雨",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "text": "我、我们要怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "悉听尊便。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "啧，你这家伙——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "——最后一个问题，你为什么要烧了那座城镇？只是刺杀一个王酋，有必要把那么多人都卷进来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "你甚至还给了平民疏散的时间——你就是单纯要烧个镇子？赤角小镇离你的地盘有十万八千里吧？你到底想干什么——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "目的很重要吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "——为了确保你不是一个真的疯子或是战争狂什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "唔，有道理，但我想你不会明白的，我烧毁的只有过去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慑砂",
      "text": "还是你的复仇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "不......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“沙卒”",
      "text": "只是一场迟到的火葬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
